 security/nss/lib/freebl/ppc-gcm-wrap.gyp      |   2 +-
 .../nss/lib/freebl/{ppc-gcm.s => ppc-gcm.S}   | 102 ++++++++++++------
 7 files changed, 156 insertions(+), 52 deletions(-)
 rename security/nss/lib/freebl/{ppc-gcm.s => ppc-gcm.S} (92%)

